@prefix ex:  <http://example.org/paper#> .
@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
ex:A ex:p ex:B .
ex:B ex:q ex:D ; ex:r ex:D .

ex:t1 rdf:subject ex:A ; rdf:predicate ex:p ; rdf:object ex:B .
ex:t2 rdf:subject ex:B ; rdf:predicate ex:q ; rdf:object ex:D .
ex:t3 rdf:subject ex:B ; rdf:predicate ex:r ; rdf:object ex:D .
